        "id": 1329040
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-06-23T00:47:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We need to check intel_svid for both, SOP and SOP_PRIME response. Hence adding enum  enum tcpm_transmit_type as one more parameter to the function. \n\nFor TCPMv2, pd_is_mode_discovered_for_svid(port, TCPC_TX_SOP, USB_VID_INTEL) can be used to check for USB_VID_INTEL. Hence moving the is_intel_svid function back to TCPMv1.\n\nWe can not use pd_is_mode_discovered_for_svid() since, USB_VID_INTEL mode is not discovered when we are checking for INTEL SVID in case of TCPMv1.",
      "parentUuid": "5b70cc1b_55e189f5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 791,
        "startChar": 55,
        "endLine": 791,
        "endChar": 66
      },
